{
  "summary": "Bill Ackman argues that successful value investing requires buying companies with durable moats at a deep discount to their intrinsic value, which is the present value of their future cash flows. He illustrates this framework through his investments in businesses like Universal Music Group, Chipotle, Restaurant Brands, and Alphabet.",
